### Get client memory (phone without '+', or '+' encoded as %2B)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/memory/998901234567
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Update operator part of client memory (null keeps, "" clears)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/memory/998901234567
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "preferredName": "Anvar aka",
  "preferredLanguage": "uz-UZ",
  "operatorNotes": "Kechqurun 18:00 dan keyin qo'ng'iroq qilish qulay"
}
